Packages/MemoshiIPC's MemoshiTransport product, on both native Mac IPC endpoints:

  https://github.com/apple/swift-nio
  EXACT 2.104.0
  revision 6db9d9abd92ad7399b8a564cafbb87d3507245fa

The same exact dependency supplies MemoshiCore's production MemoshiEgress
gateway, which MemoshiRuntime links, and the loopback HTTP provider fixture in
MemoshiRuntimeTests. MemoshiStore does not link NIO.

