GPL-3.0 module for iPhone and iPad
----------------------------------

The emulated Linux computer on iPhone and iPad will use iSH, through Open Minis's
ARM64 version (OpenMinis/ish-arm64). iSH and any code taken from Open Minis are
licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3, so they will live in
their own GPL-3.0 module that only the iPhone and iPad app links. The Mac app and
memoshid link no GPL code. The iPhone and iPad app is then a combined work under
GPL-3.0: if it is ever distributed, its source must be offered with it, and no
closed-source code may be part of it.


