Native MLS development dependency
---------------------------------

Packages/MemoshiMLS consumes awslabs/mls-rs 0.57.0 at revision
a1436f4a5433214ed62349e77835b57a0accdc42 (Apache-2.0 OR MIT), with the
CryptoKit provider 0.11.0 from the same immutable source. The retained provider
has the explicitly listed packaging and failure-handling modifications in
Packages/MemoshiMLS/Native/PROVENANCE.json; it is not an unmodified vendor copy.
Memoshi's wrapper is original source. The upstream OpenSSL UniFFI wrapper is
not used, and no alternative cryptographic provider is substituted.

UniFFI 0.32.2's unmodified runtime retains MPL-2.0. Its precise normal/codegen
dependency distinction, source revision and source-availability link are in
Native/PROVENANCE.json; runtime object membership is not inferred from the
Cargo dependency graph. Generated Swift attribution is in
Packages/MemoshiMLS/Sources/MemoshiMLSNativeBindings/NOTICE.

Packages/MemoshiMLS/Native/Licenses/manifest.json records the locked dependency
inventory and hashes of its retained original licence/copyright/notice files.
Those files, the MPL source link and the generated-binding notice must accompany
any redistributed native payload; this repository notice is not a substitute
for them. The r-efi MIT selection and debug_tree 0.4.0's upstream missing
standalone licence-file boundary are recorded explicitly rather than inventing
an upstream grant. No independent cryptographic audit or release clearance is
asserted by this development packaging.


Offline scientific-stack development payload
-------------------------------------------

Packages/MemoshiApp/Sources/PyodideSpike/Resources/Runtime contains selected,
unmodified Pyodide 314.0.7 runtime files and their scientific wheel dependency
closure. Pyodide source revision:
b1e4fcc2488962f6360a97f19b9982d6fdb5d16f

Pyodide retains MPL-2.0; CPython, Emscripten, NumPy, pandas, SciPy, Matplotlib
and the remaining wheels retain their own terms. Runtime/SOURCE-NOTICE.txt
supplies the exact upstream source and core-archive links. Runtime/manifest.json
records individual source URLs, hashes, versions and notice locations;
Runtime/Licences retains the corresponding metadata and licence files.
No scientific package is relicensed by Memoshi's Apache licence.

These resources are an explicit private S6 spike. Their inclusion is not
physical-device qualification, public redistribution clearance, a decision to
enable runtime package downloads, or a substitute for signing/release gates.


Native accent contrast derivation
--------------------------------

Packages/MemoshiApp/Sources/DesignSystem/NativeAccentColor.swift is original
Swift implementing the published OKLab/linear-sRGB transformations described by
Björn Ottosson at https://bottosson.github.io/posts/oklab/ (coefficients updated
2021-01-25). The article explicitly offers its code under the public domain
or the MIT licence. This implementation uses the public-domain option for
the published mathematical coefficients; no third-party artwork is imported.
Quantized contrast derivation does not establish native material, physical
device, accessibility or reference-hardware qualification.


